WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.450
In 914 the Sajid emir Yusuf
had King Smbat I put to death,

2
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:13.286
and his son Ashot II
inherited a ruined kingdom.

3
00:00:13.326 --> 00:00:18.176
Year after year he fought on
against rebels, rivals and invaders,

4
00:00:18.216 --> 00:00:21.875
and Armenians remember him
as Erkat, the Iron.

5
00:00:22.235 --> 00:00:27.304
In 921 the Sajid general Beshir
marched on Lake Sevan.

6
00:00:27.344 --> 00:00:29.694
The king had withdrawn to the island,

7
00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:32.819
where the monastery
of Sevanavank stood.

8
00:00:32.859 --> 00:00:35.889
Beshir's host gathered
on the shore facing it.

9
00:00:36.249 --> 00:00:39.519
The king put seventy
of his best archers into boats,

10
00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:41.539
and they made for the shore.

11
00:00:41.579 --> 00:00:44.769
Their arrows fell on the ranks
massed at the water's edge,

12
00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:47.453
and Beshir's men
broke and fled.

13
00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:50.663
The Iron King beat back
attack after attack,

14
00:00:50.703 --> 00:00:55.079
and died in 929
still master of his kingdom.

15
00:00:55.439 --> 00:00:58.431
String the bows, launch the boats.

